1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,100
Andres: My recording is back after the gate.

2
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,000
[Team]: Bring it over to the playground slide.

3
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,100
[Team]: is a zombie in the shopping cart.

4
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,400
[Team]: Throw the body down the slide!

5
