11
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:45,400
[Team]: Let us park everything under the bridge.

12
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:09,800
[Team]: I can still see the cart on the roof.

13
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,100
Andres: That is the end of my recording.
